---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import enTranslations from '../../locales/en/translation.json'

const pageTitle = enTranslations.page_title || 'Voting Handbook'
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <section class="w-full">
    <h1
      class="title bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-two/85 via-accent-one/85 to-accent-two/85 bg-clip-text text-center text-transparent dark:from-accent-two dark:via-accent-one dark:to-accent-two"
    >
      Voting from Abroad – Simple, Digital, Secure
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      A tool for Serbian citizens living abroad who wish to register to vote. We
      help you fill out the form, attach your passport, and send the application
      to the embassy – hassle-free.
      <br /><br />
      A process that once required printing, scanning, and hours of searching for
      information now takes just a few minutes. All data is processed locally on
      your device, with no storage or sending to servers – fully secure and transparent.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-6 w-full">
    <h2 class="title mb-4 text-center text-xl text-accent-two">
      Important Notice
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      This website is <strong
        >not an official platform of any government institution</strong
      >, but an independent initiative aimed at helping Serbian citizens abroad
      register for voting more easily.
      <br /><br />
      <strong>We do not collect or store any personal data.</strong> All information
      is processed <strong>locally</strong> on your device – nothing is sent to servers
      or saved online.
      <br /><br />
      Using this website is <strong>completely optional</strong>. You can also
      fill out the registration form manually. Detailed instructions are
      available on the <a
        href="https://www.mfa.gov.rs"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent-two underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
        >official website of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs</a
      > or through your nearest embassy or consulate.
      <br /><br />
      Our mission is to offer a simpler and more secure way to exercise your voting
      rights – with full control and transparency. Your vote can be crucial – use
      it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 w-full">
    <div
      class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 sm:flex-row"
    >
      <a
        href="/en/handbook"
        class="rounded-lg bg-accent-one px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition duration-200 hover:bg-accent-one/90"
      >
        Learn More
      </a>
      <a
        href="/en/voting"
        class="rounded-lg border border-accent-one px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-accent-one transition duration-200 hover:bg-accent-one hover:text-white"
      >
        Submit Request
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
